Copyright 2026 AkinVox

This distribution replaces the waveform decoder of Kokoro-82M by hexgrad
(Apache-2.0) with a mel head trained by AkinVox, followed by the unmodified
public Vocos vocoder by Charactr (MIT). The text frontend, duration, pitch and
energy predictors and the voice packs are those of Kokoro-82M.

Kokoro-82M and Vocos weights are fetched separately from their pinned upstream
repositories. Third-party software and weights retain their licenses; see
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and licenses/.
